    <briefdescription>
<para>Image data from a measurement that stays resident in CUDA device memory. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Obtained from <ref refid="classcuvis_1_1Measurement_1afe742ef20e78d4cbacc522fc4e4020ea" kindref="member">Measurement::cuda_image</ref>. Mirrors <ref refid="structcuvis_1_1image__t" kindref="compound">image_t</ref>, except the host pointer is replaced by a device buffer reachable through <ref refid="classcuvis_1_1CudaImage_1abe1909e766c7b97771ca45552119d2f0" kindref="member">view</ref> (same process) or <ref refid="classcuvis_1_1CudaImage_1a6fb0d5017569c764cf47df6332199ed3" kindref="member">make_ipc</ref> (another process). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
